                <pb facs="0842" n="738" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg738"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>No official record of the conversation during this luncheon meeting has been
                    found. The Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg659">p.
                        659</ref>, does not mention Colonel Roosevelt as a participant, but from
                    Elliott Roosevelt, <ref target="#pg-seq-300-chart-2">p. 208</ref>, it appears
                    that he was there and that the principal topic of conversation was the language
                    of the proposed communiqué to the press respecting <pb facs="0843" n="739"
                        xml:id="pg739"/> the conversations with Inönü. For the text of the
                    communiqué, see <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>, <ref target="#pg831">p.
                        831</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
